{"t":"EQT","made":"2026-11-06 14:38","name":"EQT Corporation","ko":null,"sector":"Energy","industry":"Oil & Gas E&P","employees":1523,"hq":"Canonsburg, PA, United States","website":"https://www.eqt.com","summary_en":"EQT Corporation engages in the exploration, production, gathering, and transmission of hydrocarbons and natural gas. The company sells natural gas, natural gas liquids, and oil to marketers, utilities, and industrial customers located in the Appalachian Basin. It also provides marketing services and contractual pipeline capacity management services, as well as engages in risk management and hedging activities. In addition, it owns and operates propane storage and distribution terminals. The company was formerly known as Equitable Resources Inc. and changed its name to EQT Corporation in February 2009. EQT Corporation was founded in 1888 and is headquartered in Canonsburg, Pennsylvania.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"EQT Corporation은 탄화수소 및 천연가스의 탐사, 생산, 수집 및 운송에 종사하고 있습니다. 이 회사는 애팔래치아 분지에 위치한 마케팅 담당자, 공공 시설 및 산업 고객에게 천연 가스, 천연 가스 액체 및 석유를 판매합니다. 또한 마케팅 서비스와 계약 파이프라인 용량 관리 서비스를 제공할 뿐만 아니라 위험 관리 및 헤징 활동에도 참여합니다. 또한 프로판 저장 및 유통 터미널을 소유 및 운영하고 있습니다. 이 회사는 이전에 Equitable Resources Inc.로 알려졌으며 2009년 2월에 EQT Corporation으로 이름을 변경했습니다. EQT Corporation은 1888년에 설립되었으며 펜실베이니아 주 캐논스버그에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":50.62,"mcap":31665311744.0,"pe":11.995261,"fpe":14.423132,"peg":1.3082,"ps":3.4608319,"pb":1.2434597,"ev_ebitda":5.999,"div":1.34,"beta":0.669,"hi52":68.24,"lo52":47.94},"fin":{"rev":9149624320.0,"rev_g":-0.081,"eps_g":-0.17,"gross":0.80401003,"op":0.28235,"net":0.29012,"roe":0.104890004,"fcf":2475727616.0,"cash":78715000.0,"debt":5552551936.0,"de":19.134,"eps":4.22,"feps":3.50964},"own":{"short":0.0398,"inst":0.95755994,"insider":0.00901},"analyst":{"n":22,"mean":66.86364,"median":67.5,"high":77.0,"low":52.0,"rec":"strong_buy","recMean":1.5,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":3,"buy":15,"hold":4,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":